WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.880
The Parent Info Page

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:06.470
No more forty texts to find out who’s coming.

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:10.480
Parents open a link, with no account to create.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:13.150
They pick their child…

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:16.660
… and answer attendance with a single tap.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:24.780
Each family sees their own child’s season: games, positions, plate appearances. Never anyone else’s.

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:27.710
There’s the whole team’s chat…

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:30.930
… and a private thread with the coaches.

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:35.230
The lineup is posted for them thirty minutes before the game.

00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:39.600
Lineup, stats: you decide what parents see.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.810
Rain? Cancel the game in the app…

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:52.120
… and parents are notified right away. Schedule, attendance, lineup, messages: everything in one place.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:57.530
BaseballLineup. Less paperwork, more baseball.
